NON-BLOCKING OBSERVATIONS (no requirement violated; reported, not fixed)

  - filemanager.html:1340 etc.: the button class list contains `rounded` twice.
    Cosmetic duplication, no behavioural or a11y effect.
  - filemanager.html:539: `var btn = th.querySelector('[data-sort-btn]');` in
    renderIndicators is assigned and never used. Dead local; harmless.
  - filemanager.html:520: applySort returns early when the table has zero data
    rows, so on an emptied list aria-sort is not re-applied to the header. With
    no rows to describe there is nothing for aria-sort to reference, so this is
    defensible rather than a defect.

None of these affect items 1-6. Verdict stands: PASS.
